Package: thermal-camera-redux
Version: 0.9.3-1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libopencv-core410, libopencv-imgproc410, libopencv-imgcodecs410, libopencv-videoio410, libopencv-highgui410, udev
Maintainer: Sertac Tulluk <stulluk@gmail.com>
Description: Thermal Camera Redux for InfiRay-family USB cameras
 Viewer for 256x192 USB thermal cameras that present as UVC
 0bda:5830 (Qianli Super IRCam Pro 2S, Topdon TC001, InfiRay P2 Pro).
 The 'redux' command auto-selects that device and does not require
 DISPLAY or LD_LIBRARY_PATH in a normal desktop session.
 .
 Upstream: https://github.com/92es/Thermal-Camera-Redux
